# Deno lockfile. Ignored rather than committed: there is no deno.json anywhere
# in the repo, this pins only the jsr:@std/assert the EF unit tests import, and
# the CI deploy (supabase functions deploy --use-api) never reads it. It is
# regenerated by `deno test` on any machine that runs the suite.
deno.lock
